# Anticausal Vestige cast for its full {6} (Island, three Moxen, Black Lotus) and then exiled by Bot2's Swords to Plowshares:
# any way of leaving the battlefield triggers it, not only warp's exile. Draw first: Mox Emerald is drawn, so it is in the
# hand for the choice (mana value 0 <= 1 land) and Bot1 puts it onto the battlefield tapped. Mind Stone (2 > 1 land) is
# not offered. Swords gives Bot1 life equal to its power, 7.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Anticausal Vestige
Mind Stone
Mox Emerald
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Swords to Plowshares
Plains x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Anticausal Vestige.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Anticausal Vestige)
! Bot1.Choose(Mind Stone)
Bot1.Choose(Mox Emerald)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Exile = Anticausal Vestige
Bot1.Life = 27
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 5
Bot1.Hand = Mind Stone
